        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Linen ground, embroidered with red, blue, green, yellow and black silks in cross stitch.  Symmetrical stylized pattern showing a vase of flowers in center flanked by two large peacocks, smaller birds and quadrupeds, large double-headed eagles and leaves.  Along top, a subordinate frieze showing peacocks alternating with double-headed eagles.  Many holes in ground, darned and patched.  Black silk almost entirely rotted out."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/9b8bd4f5-81ac-34bc-8d36-2ab87c1777a5> .

